It is Monday morning in February.
I am sitting in my flat.
I look at my calendar.
I have plans almost every day.
My week is very full.
I go to the gym every Tuesday.
I also go there every Thursday.
My workout is always at half past five.
But I have even more plans this week.
My bicycle needs a repair.
I sometimes ride the bicycle.
I often take the U-Bahn to the office.
So I need an appointment for the repair.
I also need a haircut.
I need an appointment at the hairdresser.
I am organizing my week now.
But first I drink my coffee.
Then I go to the office.
